<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Search <strong>"Environment Variables"</strong> in Windows Start</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Environment Variables</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Under <strong>System Variables</strong>, find <strong>Path</strong> → click <strong>Edit</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Add your Python Scripts folder, typically:</li>
</ol>
